  "bio": "Rell is a highly skilled fine line tattoo artist based in Poznan, Poland, specializing in intricate designs that demonstrate an impressive level of detail. Clients admire Rell's professionalism, which is evident in both the meticulousness of their craft and in the way they uphold the highest standards of service at their home studio, Propaganda Tattoo. Whether you're looking for delicate cartoontattoos or complex dotwork pieces, Rell's precision and commitment to excellence are sure to exceed expectations.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Poznan, Greater Poland Voivodeship, Poland"
